Fractions are normalized over modeled crystalline phases. Fit statistics: \(R_p=7.037\%\), \(R_{wp}=9.693\%\), \(R_{exp}=2.863\%\), GOF = 3.393. Practical fraction uncertainties are approximately ±1–2 wt%; the precise WO₃ monoclinic/triclinic distortion remains less certain than its phase identity.

